diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 1a55755..653c76e 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,7 +6,15 @@ In-memory inventory service. `api.handle(request)` maps a request
 
 ## Endpoints
 
-- `GET /items` → `{"items": [...]}`: every item, ordered by `id`.
+- `GET /items` → `{"items": [...], "next_cursor": string | null}`: one page of
+  items, ordered ascending by `id`.
+  - `limit` (optional query param): integer from 1 to 100, default 20.
+  - `cursor` (optional query param): opaque string taken from a previous
+    response's `next_cursor`. Omit it for the first page; pass it back
+    unchanged to get the next page.
+  - `next_cursor` is `null` on the last page.
+  - 400 `{"error": "..."}` when `limit` is not an integer in range, or when
+    `cursor` is malformed.
 - `GET /items/<id>` → the item, 404 when unknown, 400 when `id` is not a number.
 
 Run the tests with `python3 -m unittest`.
